      "code": "# 72. 编辑距离\n# 给定两个单词 word1 和 word2，计算出将 word1 转换成 word2 的最少操作数\n#\n# 允许的三种操作:\n#   1. 插入一个字符\n#   2. 删除一个字符\n#   3. 替换一个字符\n#\n# 示例:\n#   word1 = \"horse\", word2 = \"ros\"\n#   horse → rorse (替换 'h' 为 'r')\n#   rorse → rose (删除 'r')\n#   rose → ros (删除 'e')\n#   结果: 3\n\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef minDistance(word1: str, word2: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"返回 word1 转换为 word2 的最少操作数。\"\"\"\n    m, n = len(word1), len(word2)\n    dp = [[0] * (n + 1) for _ in range(m + 1)]\n\n    for i in range(m + 1):\n        dp[i][0] = i\n    for j in range(n + 1):\n        dp[0][j] = j\n\n    for i in range(1, m + 1):\n        for j in range(1, n + 1):\n            if word1[i - 1] == word2[j - 1]:\n                dp[i][j] = dp[i - 1][j - 1]",
